# N.B. do not add dist/ here. The action as run by workflows that consume this
# (in action.yml) just checks out this repo, installs scanner-cli, and then
# runs `node dist/index.js`. It's convenient to have the dist/ bundle included
# in the repo so we don't have to install dependencies + build on every
# workflow run.
